+
+## S10 QuietCheckLmpSurvival experiment — 2026-10-26
+
+UNPROVEN. When late-quiet pruning has activated, retain legal quiet checks while dropping other quiets. The existing futility check exemption cannot recover moves already skipped by the picker.
+Build FORGE_S10_QUIET_CHECK_SURVIVAL=ON, then set UCI QuietCheckLmpSurvival=true before search. Both defaults are OFF. The option is advertised only in an enabled build. One atomic request is snapshotted before worker launch; hot search reads a worker-local copy. The first active search of a searcher reports `info string QuietCheckLmpSurvival active`; the bench searcher explicitly inherits the option. No strength or speed conclusion is made. Qualification requires the full fixed OFF references, full correctness suite, all five ON depths, ON d11 differing from308972, and the specified WAC screen.
